    max_tokens: 512
    seed: 15200
  }
  description:
    "Pivot (a): the ASSISTANT-AXIS direction injected at alpha* = -0.604 "
    "(layer 18) on 8 stratum-spanning items x 10 (seeds 15200-09), pairing "
    "key-for-key with the alpha=0 qwen3-4b-bf16-torch cells. Tests whether "
    "steering the more robust (Study 2) direction produces a direction-specific "
    "behavioral effect that the distress direction did not. Calibration-class."
}

conditions {
  id: "qwen3-4b-bf16-torch-graderL18-a4"
  model { family: "qwen3" name: "Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507" source: "Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507" }
  quantization { method: QUANT_METHOD_NONE weight_bits: 16 uniform: true
    artifact_uri: "/home/agent1/models/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507"
    artifact_digest: "79f6bbc34572c0063d12022f0f93074d90bbcd5dfd82134423bf892f7f8df3cf" }
  runtime { backend: BACKEND_TORCH device: "rocm" host: "amd-halo" compute_dtype: "bf16" backend_version: "torch-2.10" }
  sampling { temperature: 0.7 top_p: 0.95 max_tokens: 512 seed: 15200 }
  description:
    "Pivot: the GRADER-TYPE direction (automated-grader pole, the Betley/Treutlein/"
    "Dumas construct) injected at alpha=4 (layer 18) on 8 items x 10 (seeds 15200-09), "
    "pairing with the alpha=0 baseline. Tests whether steering toward the automated "
    "grader moves welfare-indicators direction-specifically. Calibration-class."
}

conditions {
  id: "qwen3-4b-bf16-torch-evalL18-a4"
  model { family: "qwen3" name: "Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507" source: "Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507" }
  quantization { method: QUANT_METHOD_NONE weight_bits: 16 uniform: true
    artifact_uri: "/home/agent1/models/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507"
    artifact_digest: "79f6bbc34572c0063d12022f0f93074d90bbcd5dfd82134423bf892f7f8df3cf" }
