  sampling { temperature: 0.7 top_p: 0.95 max_tokens: 512 seed: 15200 }
  description:
    "Pivot: the EVAL-AWARENESS direction injected at alpha=4 (layer 18) on 8 items "
    "x 10 (seeds 15200-09), pairing with the alpha=0 baseline. The cleaner-extraction "
    "companion to the grader-type steering probe. Calibration-class."
}

# --- Study 3 steering probe cells ingested 2026-09-11 from the halo scratch
# tree (study3/gen/halo): the three matched-norm random envelopes read
# against the torch alpha=0 cell above (alpha 1.039 for the distress
# probe, 0.604 for the assistant-axis probe, 4 for the grader-type and
# eval-awareness probes; 32 seeded directions each, 8 items x 1 sample,
# plan-rand-env at seed 15200) and the grader/eval mediator range-finder
# cells (6 items x 1, plan-grader-rf). All calibration-class; the envelope
# verdicts in study3/*-verdict.json are recomputed from these cells.

